SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This MIT license covers ONLY the DocuTune project source code and the
synthetic dataset generated by this repository's deterministic generator.

It explicitly does NOT cover:

1. THE BASE MODEL. The fine-tuned artifact is a LoRA adapter applied on top
   of a third-party open-source model (by default
   microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct, MIT licensed at the time of writing -
   verify the current license in the model's Hugging Face repository before
   use). The base model, its weights and its license terms remain the
   property of their respective authors and are governed by their own
   license. See docs/MODEL_CARD.md.

2. THIRD-PARTY FALLBACK MODELS (meta-llama/Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct is governed
   by the Llama Community License; Qwen/Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct by the Qwen
   license). Check each model card for current terms.
